\color{black}\cxtag{174}{N/S}Generative AI tools (Infinity, Kiro, Claude and ChatGPT) were used as interactive writing and
reviewing assistants during the preparation of this work, including drafting
and revising text, and checking mathematical arguments with Lean proofs.  All
content was reviewed, validated, and approved by the author.
